                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>Retool or custom for internal tools?</h3>
                                        <p>Retool for anything under 20 users and simple. Custom above that or when Retool limits become blockers.</p>
                                        <h3>Can I build a real customer-facing product on Bubble?</h3>
                                        <p>For an MVP or early-stage product, yes. For anything requiring scale, complex features, or performance, migrate to custom by ₹5 Cr ARR.</p>
                                        <h3>Mendix / OutSystems for enterprise apps?</h3>
                                        <p>Right for large enterprises with 50+ internal apps to build and standardize.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest no-code failure?</h3>
                                        <p>Governance failure. Employees build 200 disconnected tools; nobody owns them; they break silently; support debt accumulates. Standardize before sprawl.</p>
